# 7xCircle Wallet — Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (web) or `.env` (mobile) and fill in the
# values for your environment. NEVER commit `.env.local` to version control.
#
# ── General ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# No required general vars. The wallet works with public RPCs by default.

# ── Explorer API Keys (optional, for faster history queries) ─────────────
# Etherscan / BscScan / Polygonscan API key. Without it, history queries
# are rate-limited to 5 req/s (free tier). With a key, you get 100 req/s.
# EXPLORER_API_KEY=your_key_here

# ── Swap: Solana (Jupiter) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Platform fee in basis points (1–500, Jupiter's cap). Default: 50 (0.5%).
# VITE_SWAP_FEE_BPS=50

# Wallet address that RECEIVES the platform fee (base58 Solana pubkey).
# If empty, Solana swap fees are disabled (no fee routing).
# VITE_SWAP_FEE_WALLET=your_solana_pubkey

# Custom Jupiter API base URL (optional). Default: https://lite-api.jup.ag
# VITE_JUPITER_BASE_URL=https://lite-api.jup.ag

# ── Swap: EVM (0x) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠ KEY EXPOSURE WARNING: Vite inlines VITE_ZEROX_API_KEY into the bundle.
# Anyone can read it from the JS, so direct-to-0x is LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY.
# For production, deploy a thin gateway (Cloudflare Worker, etc.) that
# holds the key server-side, and point VITE_ZEROX_BASE_URL at it.
#
# 0x API key (optional, but recommended for higher rate limits).
# VITE_ZEROX_API_KEY=your_0x_key

# Gateway / proxy URL for 0x quotes. If set, the adapter calls this
# instead of the default 0x host. The gateway should inject the API key
# server-side so it never reaches the browser.
# VITE_ZEROX_BASE_URL=https://your-gateway.example.com/swap/v1

# Platform fee in basis points (1–1000, 0x's cap). Default: same as VITE_SWAP_FEE_BPS.
# VITE_SWAP_FEE_BPS_EVM=50

# EVM wallet address that RECEIVES the platform fee (0x address).
# If empty, EVM swap fees are disabled.
# VITE_SWAP_FEE_WALLET_EVM=0xYourEvmAddress

# ── TRON Energy Rental (TronSave) ───────────────────────────────────────
# TronSave API base URL (optional). Default: https://api.tronsave.io
# VITE_TRONSAVE_BASE_URL=https://api.tronsave.io

# Sponsor / referral code for TronSave orders. Required to earn platform
# commission on energy rentals. Apply at https://tronsave.io → Agency.
# VITE_TRONSAVE_SPONSOR_CODE=your_sponsor_code

# ── Stablecoin Yield Discovery (LI.FI Earn) ─────────────────────────────
# LI.FI Earn Data API key (optional, keyless tier available).
# VITE_LIFI_EARN_API_KEY=your_lifi_key

# LI.FI Earn base URL (optional). Default: https://li.quest/v1
# VITE_LIFI_EARN_BASE_URL=https://li.quest/v1

# App URL for LI.FI Earn deposits (optional, links out to protocol).
# VITE_LIFI_EARN_APP_URL=https://app.li.fi

# ── SOL Liquid Staking Referral (Marinade) ──────────────────────────────
# Marinade referral code (base58 Solana pubkey). When set, every SOL
# stake through the wallet earns both the user and the wallet +0.125%
# APY from Marinade's existing fee. Apply at https://marinade.finance
# → Referral Program.
# VITE_MARINADE_REFERRAL_CODE=your_marinade_referral_pubkey

# Custom Marinade router base URL (optional).
# VITE_MARINADE_ROUTER_BASE_URL=https://marinade.finance/api/v1

# ── WalletConnect (Mobile) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# WalletConnect v2 project ID. Required for dApp pairing on mobile.
# The app ships with a default relay project ID; override for production.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_WC_PROJECT_ID=your_walletconnect_project_id

# ── Swap platform fee (Mobile / Expo) ────────────────────────────────
# Same monetization contract as the VITE_ swap blocks above, read at Expo
# BUILD time by apps/mobile/src/config.ts (changing values requires a new
# bundle — there is no runtime env in RN). Solana fees ride Jupiter's
# platformFeeBps + the fee wallet's derived ATA; EVM fees ride 0x's
# swapFeeBps + recipient. Invalid or absent values disable the fee only —
# swaps keep working. Same warning as above: a 0x key inlined into the
# RN bundle is public — treat EXPO_PUBLIC_ZEROX_API_KEY as dev-only.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SWAP_FEE_BPS=50
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SWAP_FEE_WALLET=your_solana_pubkey
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SWAP_FEE_WALLET_EVM=0xYourEvmAddress
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ZEROX_API_KEY=your_0x_key
